{"id":"ab68772f0e179877","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-topo8-p-point.md","title":"ZFC Topo8 P Point","display":"df-zfc-topo8-p-point — ZFC Topo8 P Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo8-p-point","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo8-p-point"],"display":"df-zfc-topo8-p-point — ZFC Topo8 P Point","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-topo10-neighborhood-filter]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo8-p-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo8-p-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo8-p-point — ZFC Topo8 P Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set\">58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2575184b4e64f399\" href=\"?note=2575184b4e64f399\" title=\"58-df-zfc-topo10-neighborhood-filter\">58-df-zfc-topo10-neighborhood-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in X\">\\(p\\in X\\)</span> (point)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\">\\(X,\\tau\\)</span> (topological space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\">\\(\\mathcal N\\)</span> (neighborhood-filter family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10NeighborhoodFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10NeighborhoodFilter}_S\\)</span> (neighborhood-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2575184b4e64f399\" href=\"?note=2575184b4e64f399\" title=\"58-df-zfc-topo10-neighborhood-filter\">58-df-zfc-topo10-neighborhood-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\\)</span> (at-most-countable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set\">58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8PPoint}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8PPoint}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}p\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8PPoint}_S(p,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land p\\in X\\land\\exists\\mathcal N\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10NeighborhoodFilter}_S(\\mathcal N,X,\\tau,p)\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(\\mathcal U)\\land\\mathcal U\\neq\\emptyset\\to\\exists V\\in\\mathcal N\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathcal U\\;(V\\subseteq U)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}p\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8PPoint}_S(p,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land p\\in X\\land\\exists\\mathcal N\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10NeighborhoodFilter}_S(\\mathcal N,X,\\tau,p)\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(\\mathcal U)\\land\\mathcal U\\neq\\emptyset\\to\\exists V\\in\\mathcal N\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathcal U\\;(V\\subseteq U)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Countability and the pseudointersection condition are expanded through actual predicates and pointwise containment, avoiding two undefined set-forming operators.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set","status":"resolved","id":"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-topo10-neighborhood-filter","status":"resolved","id":"2575184b4e64f399","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-topo10-neighborhood-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-topo10-neighborhood-filter","status":"resolved","id":"2575184b4e64f399","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10NeighborhoodFilter}_S$ (neighborhood-filter predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-topo10-neighborhood-filter]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate, see [[58-df-topological-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set","status":"resolved","id":"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S$ (at-most-countable-set predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10NeighborhoodFilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8PPoint}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}p\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8PPoint}_S(p,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land p\\in X\\land\\exists\\mathcal N\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10NeighborhoodFilter}_S(\\mathcal N,X,\\tau,p)\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(\\mathcal U)\\land\\mathcal U\\neq\\emptyset\\to\\exists V\\in\\mathcal N\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathcal U\\;(V\\subseteq U)\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1532,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3705","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-topo8-p-point.md|58-df-zfc-topo8-p-point]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","2575184b4e64f399","815e63e5071e7b58"]}